<!--
  WoW: Forever (game type "camelot") enforces secret values: health, power,
  auras, cast info and the identity of non-group units are unreadable from
  addon code. Every module that reads such a value in Lua is left out here
  until it has been rebuilt on the engine-side primitives (see
  doc/forever-support.md). The manifest is derived from modules_TBC.xml;
  Forever is the vanilla expansion, so the same expansion-only exclusions
  apply.
-->

